  "slug": "room-block-sign-in-sheet-form",
  "title": "Room Block Sign-In Sheet Form",
  "subtitle": "Run a group arrival at a dedicated desk: check guests in against the rooming list, issue keys, and record who has not arrived.",
  "description": "An original group arrival register. It records the arrival identity and desk plan, each guest checked in against the rooming list with room assigned and keys issued, arrival-wave tracking, guests not yet arrived, exceptions such as a missing reservation or an unissued accessible room, and an accountable closeout.",
  "use_case": "Use at a group check-in desk when many guests arrive together and the front office needs a single record of who has checked in, into which room, with how many keys. The register closes when every rooming-list line is accounted for.",
  "risk_tier": "A",
