            "Pre-assigned rooms and key packets sorted by guest name",
            "Accessible rooms confirmed as assigned before the guest arrives",
            "Billing routing briefed to every agent on the desk",
            "Incidental authorization approach briefed to every agent",
            "Group contact identified to the desk by name",
            "Bag storage and delivery point confirmed with bell staff",
            "Early arrival rooms tracked against housekeeping readiness"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
