              "units": 1.15
            }
          ],
          "rows": 3
        },
        {
          "key": "register_boundary",
          "type": "notice",
          "label": "Purpose and limits of this register",
          "guidance": "This register exists to run one group arrival: who checked in, into which room, with how many keys. It is not an identity verification, a credit decision, or a record of guest payment details. Keep it out of guest view when unattended, retain it only as long as applicable privacy and retention policy allows, and route relocation, rate, and charge disputes to the responsible manager."
        }
      ]
    },
